			"notes": "Update for Minecraft 26.1\n\nNote: This is an initial port. The full custom health bar rendering is stubbed out and needs additional work due to significant API changes in 26.x:\n- InGameHud class removed, replaced with Gui class\n- DrawContext replaced with GuiGraphicsExtractor  \n- Text replaced with Component\n- Various other API changes\n\nThe mod loads and runs on 26.1, but the custom health bar rendering is not yet functional."
